1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,740
(Sheldon:)Leonard could
frequent sushi bars,

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,650
(Sheldon:)salad bars, oyster bars,

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,020
(Sheldon:)the Apple Genius Bar...
What are you doing?

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,860
(Leonard(exiting the apartment):)Keep going. I'm listening.

5
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,950
(Amy:)That was rude.

6
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,760
(Sheldon:)He does it all the time.

7
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:17,800
(Sheldon:)He's a cornucopia
of social awkwardness.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,170
(Sheldon:)Cornucopia.

9
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,200
(Amy:)What a mellifluous word.

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,060
(Sheldon:)Let's make that our word
of the day.

11
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,240
(Amy:)Agreed. And we'll use
mellifluous tomorrow.

12
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:28,040
(Sheldon:)Well, I have to void my bladder.

13
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:30,330
(Sheldon:)It was nice spending this time
with you.

14
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:31,700
(Amy:)Wait.

15
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,900
(Amy:)I have a request.

16
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,100
(Sheldon:)Yes?

17
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,540
(Amy:)I'd like you to meet my mother.

18
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,700
(Sheldon:)I see.

19
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,470
(Sheldon:)Can I get back to you on that?

20
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,220
(Amy:)Certainly. Good night.

21
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,430
(Amy:)Good night.

22
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:49,650
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,
Leonard, Leonard,

23
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:52,320
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Leonard,
Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,

24
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,020
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Leonard, Leonard,
Leonard, Leonard,

25
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,270
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Leonard,

26
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:57,470
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Leonard...

27
00:00:57,470 --> 00:00:58,910
(Leonard:)Yeah, what?

28
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:01,860
(Sheldon:)Amy Farrah Fowler has asked me
to meet her mother.

